macpro-fand (1.0.6) unstable; urgency=low

  * Documentation only (fifth external review of 1.0.5, which was not
    released): the 10 W staging step for an unreadable limit is the one
    bounded exception to "no step costs more than the larger of the state
    before and the target" -- at most 59.76 W of model with the default
    four-die calibration, inside the default 80 W margin; a custom margin,
    coefficients or topology need their own check. The daemon's code is
    unchanged from 1.0.5.

